{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/A-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-17-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/B-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-10-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/C-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-09-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>目前負責打理祠廟事務嘅周氏後人阿盈（化名）向本報攝影記者透露，多年前佢嘅祖父係一個蜑家漁民，一次出海時意外撈獲一尊「四姐」嘅木雕神像。祖父將神像帶回家，交畀年幼嘅阿盈當玩具玩，佢仲幫神像縫過衫褲。豈料阿盈隨後發起高燒，阿嫲夢中得到「七姐」點化，指示祖父要將神像安座供奉。周氏族人於是遵循神諭，興建咗而家嘅七姐祠。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/D-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-23-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/E-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-25-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/F-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-11-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>七姐祠以祈求姻緣靈驗聞名，阿盈分享咗一段浪漫故事話畀記者聽。三年前七夕當晚，一個帶點「嬰兒肥」嘅微胖男子耐心等候喺祠前，一直等到七月初七子夜先上香，翌年亦如期而至。直到昨日傍晚初六晚，該男子身穿紅衣，手牽女友前來還神。阿盈起初未有留意，直至對方拖住女友手、表情尷尬地對住佢笑，先認出呢位誠心嘅求緣客，親眼見證一段天賜良緣開花結果。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/G-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-02-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/H-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-04-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>談及拜祭七姐祠嘅心得，阿盈認為本質上就係同神明溝通：「直接講就得，話畀七姐聽你有咩煩惱。」就好似「傾偈」咁，若想知七姐嘅指示同結果，可以擲筊問卜。七夕期間，七姐祠唔單止係善信祈求良緣嘅神聖之地，亦係佢哋傾吐心聲嘅心靈驛站。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/I-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-05-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/J-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-27-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T16:19:58.725154+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":386,"images":11,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}